{"body":{"text":["A component may say it is drawn only where a slot names it, as a widget is: never found for a slot by itself, though it may still be chosen. So a board, a type of its own, lays out widgets each said as a mount is, its component named, the holons or the way of looking it is given and the columns it spans: a count, bars counted by a key, a timeline placed by two moments, or a list beside them, each a slot drawn live and entered by a press as any place is; a widget given one board draws that board whole within it. The work, live is such a board, held by Statistics and functions: what waits on the author, what is unratified, the threads open and where they stand, and the session's cycles in time."]},"id":"1M75VM0WSJ5A04K","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
