{"body":{"text":["The session wrote the plan into the field as the wiki's new top, a brief called Glass, as designed, standing first in The wiki ahead of the old Glass brief, which was left as it was. It runs broadest first: what glass is (the holon, stores, the engine and the field; the four kinds; the interface as holons drawn by holons); how code is written, the one stance; the code's shape, the three primitives of code and the modules at the root, each module a brief of its own (integrations, language, engine, interface, components, site); Decided by the author, the seven answers; The way there, marked as the session's proposal since the author's order was left open; and The code as it stood, 2026-11-11, a record kept apart from the design. It reads with `bun engine/ask.ts 'text(@\"Glass, as designed\")'`."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZ2KA","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
