{"body":{"text":["The session answered that it knows the shape but not the lines. Fixed by the outline and writable now: the files and what each holds; the engine's surface, roughly `engine(attachments)` returning `{ attach, detach, read, commit, subscribe }` over the field at the last commit, made anew by each; `read` answering by identity when it is `holon` or `whole` of ids, otherwise evaluating over the loaded stores, loading the store a native says it lacks and evaluating again; `commit` as residence, mint, judge, write, then the next field patched by what was written; the evaluator a switch over seven forms, natives plain tables of small functions, one file per family. Left for the implementation, where it stays organic: the exact shape of a value, a holon record and a lack (thrown or returned, how a closure carries its scope); how the field's carried parts split, clear only once patching from an act is written; where pure steps want to merge or split once written and read back; names. Each module begins as its brief, so discoveries are written back into the field as made, not guessed now."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZ4V3","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Taking \"Go\" as the start, it began the oracle, with an agent allowed to change only test files rewriting the engine's tests to speak only through the public surface. It did not do the step as first outlined, because that would have built new reads into the old engine first. The agent retargeted five test files, `kernel`, `engine`, `carried`, `patched` and `residence`, and the session reviewed the work: tests now go through attach, read, ask an expression as text, and commit; internals appear only in marked \"unit:\" sections holding what only a module can show, such as how the index was carried, to be rewritten with their module; test values and refusal messages unchanged. 310 tests pass (up from 300, some mixed tests split), typecheck clean, committed on `main` as 75801ca, not pushed."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZ4ZG","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Retargeting showed the surface lacks five things: judging a change without writing it, asking a store for its own answers, detaching a store, a shared way to ask in text, asking what a holon holds directly; the new design covers detaching and the last( `out` ). The step was written into the engine's Building it brief as actually done, with these findings. It also found a real fault in the data: \"A fork on the paper's licence, ended by the author\" references `1M6YBY3G000299W`, which is not in the field; the old test never checked references."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZ52K","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
