{"body":{"text":["The engine as a system of landing places: Engine, the front and only way in, offering mount, read, follow, commit, holding changes in flight and who follows what, deciding nothing itself. Mounts, the connections to stores and buffers, each head followed so a move is heard, the only component touching the outside (today the attachments in `field.ts` and the watching in `serve/` ). Field, the reading as one value at a moment, made from the one before plus what moved, never the truth, only the engine's view (today `field.ts` and `world.ts`, to become one). Index, facts over the field carried and patched( `read/patterns/` ). Evaluation, pure( `read/evaluate.ts`, `read/natives/`, `language/` ). Judgment, pure: moulds, what a store admits, the rules( `moulds.ts`, `change/rules.ts` ). Committing: reach from the bodies, order among changes in flight, place and mint ids, judge, offer the act to each store's head( `change/` ). Serving, the engine carried to page, command line, program( `serve/` )."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZJ58","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Together: a read goes Serving, Engine, Evaluation over the current Field, asking the Index for patterns. Following a read: each new Field, Evaluation answers again and the follower is told if it changed. A change: through Serving to Committing, ordered against changes in flight, judged over the Field and what was ordered before, offered to each store's head; Mounts hear the heads move, the next Field is made from what moved, the Index patched, followers told. A store moved by another arrives the same way. Mounting: the next Field includes the new store, and followers are told."]},"id":"1M78WEQVZBZZJ8F","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
