ience. This is depth. I think very much this is something we're going to do. Also, would it be possible, because I don't want to deviate too much here, but can we do a really simple thing with that, considering how not to make this complicated? But it would be really nice if there could be a visual diff. So I'm currently looking at glass, I'm looking at knowledge. So what would be the most minimal tweak to the interface to allow diffing? In a way where perhaps just text that is additional may be highlighted. Now maybe you decide we shouldn't, and then we don't, but it would be helpful now as I read to make it more effective for me. We've got to have all of these things later when we get there, so it's a little bit running ahead, but if it can be small and pragmatic, it would be helpful."]},"id":"1M7GHCRWKGVZ0J9","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
