{"body":{"text":["The session committed and ran three free agents. All three found that the read's holon questions should be gathered per turn and asked of each store as one, so no function in the field need ask for a whole; that strata looked every id up again from every run's root, where one agent's prototype of a sorted sweep answered the whole in 85 ms; that the evaluator awaited what it already held; and bugs in order and retries."]},"id":"1M7K3VM1CKMV0FV","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
