{"body":{"text":["The session laid out the way ahead: the interface on the new engine, the site, removing old code, settling, then main. For the interface it put a choice: an adapter turning the ten old read forms of `engine/compat.ts` into expressions, or components asking expressions directly with the old forms gone; it recommended the second, as custom glue was not favoured (11/7)."]},"id":"1M7R4Z0KHV0D02M","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
