{"body":{"text":["The session found the field between the eight was four things said independently: things join by fit not by name, the same primitive at every scale, text as one reading of a structure, and a link never a copy. That confirmed the shape but was no breakthrough. All eight images strained at the same two points: what a socket receives, where 'which face' it wants was a candidate breakthrough uniting an expression's parts or result, a brief's face or whole, and quote or evaluate; and the way back, which glass states no laws for yet. An input inside a definition is like a pronoun each use binds elsewhere, as Plan 9's namespaces. It proposed a narrower second round aimed at faces and the way back, panelists building on each other."]},"id":"1M7R4Z0KHV0D6QW","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
